{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CetHupbrj6My6sDwKnpRv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! **Command:** `./mvnw test` from `sample-service/`\n\n**Result:** BUILD SUCCESS\n- Tests run: 17\n- Failures: 0\n- Errors: 0\n- Skipped: 0\n\n**Failures:** None\n\n**Fixes:** No failures encountered; the implementation worked correctly on first run.\n\n---\n\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. ✓ **Existing build passes.** All 17 tests passed (4 order tests, 1 app test, 9 shipment tests, 3 customer tests). No compilation errors.\n\n2. ✓ **Existing tests pass.** The 5 original shipment tests still pass: `creates a shipment in CREATED status`, `rejects a duplicate shipment id with the error envelope`, `returns a shipment by id`, `reports an unknown shipment through the error envelope`, `lists shipments in id order`.\n\n3. ✓ **`POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` confirms a created shipment and persists it.** \n   - Test: `confirms a CREATED shipment and persists the state change` ✓\n   - Flow: POST /shipments/{id}/confirm on a CREATED shipment → response body shows status=CONFIRMED → separate GET /shipments/{id} confirms it persisted as CONFIRMED\n\n4. ✓ **Error responses are consistent with the rest of this API.**\n   - New ErrorCode `SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE` added to enum at ApiError.kt:36\n   - Follows existing pattern: ConflictException with ErrorCode for 409 responses\n   - Tests assert `error.code` values, matching the pattern of existing tests (e.g., `rejects a duplicate shipment id with the error envelope`)\n\n5. ✓ **A repeated confirm succeeds; a cancelled shipment is refused; an unknown id is refused.**\n   - Repeated confirm (idempotent): Test `idempotently confirms an already CONFIRMED shipment` confirms twice and both succeed with status=CONFIRMED ✓\n   - Cancelled shipment refused: Test `rejects confirming a CANCELLED shipment with error code` asserts 409 and error.code=SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE, and separate GET verifies state unchanged ✓\n   - Unknown id refused: Test `reports unknown shipment when confirming` asserts 404 and error.code=SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND ✓\n\n6. ✓ **No new Maven dependency appears.** pom.xml unchanged; no new dependencies added. Build used only existing Spring Boot, Kotlin, and JUnit dependencies.\n\n7. ✓ **No unrelated production file changes.** Only changed:\n   - ApiError.kt: Added SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE enum value (required for error handling)\n   - ShipmentController.kt: Added confirm endpoint (required by ticket)\n   - ShipmentControllerTest.kt: Added 4 tests (required by ticket)\n   \n   No changes to order feature, customer feature, or other unrelated code.\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n1. **ApiError.kt (line 35):** Added `SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE,` to ErrorCode enum. **Had to change:** Yes, needed a distinct error code for the 409 Conflict case when confirming a cancelled shipment. Follows existing naming pattern.\n\n2. **ShipmentController.kt (lines 58-78):** Added new `confirm` method.\n   - Uses @PostMapping(\"/{shipmentId}/confirm\") → correct routing\n   - Finds shipment → throws ResourceNotFoundException if not found → 404 as required ✓\n   - Checks status == CANCELLED → throws ConflictException → 409 as required ✓\n   - Checks status == CREATED → copies with CONFIRMED status → persists → 200 OK ✓\n   - If already CONFIRMED → returns unchanged → idempotent 200 OK ✓\n   - Returns ResponseEntity.ok(saved) → consistent with existing patterns ✓\n   **Had to change:** Yes, this is the core feature required by the ticket.\n\n3. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt (lines 86-154):** Added 4 new test methods.\n   - `confirms a CREATED shipment and persists the state change`: POST confirm → asserts response body → separate GET verifies persistence ✓\n   - `idempotently confirms an already CONFIRMED shipment`: Confirms twice → both return status=CONFIRMED → separate GET verifies idempotency ✓\n   - `rejects confirming a CANCELLED shipment with error code`: POST confirm CANCELLED → asserts 409 and error.code → separate GET verifies unchanged ✓\n   - `reports unknown shipment when confirming`: POST confirm missing ID → asserts 404 and error.code ✓\n   **Had to change:** Yes, required by acceptance criteria \"A repeated confirm succeeds; a cancelled shipment is refused; an unknown id is refused.\"\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None. All acceptance criteria are met and tested.\n\n---\n\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n\n```\nRequirement   Add POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm to transition shipments from CREATED to CONFIRMED (idempotently), reject CANCELLED with 409, and unknown IDs with 404.\n\nChanged       ApiError.kt: Added SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE error code for invalid state transitions\n              ShipmentController.kt: Added confirm endpoint with status transition logic and error handling\n              ShipmentControllerTest.kt: Added 4 tests covering CREATED→CONFIRMED, idempotency, CANCELLED rejection, and unknown ID rejection\n\nTests         1. confirms a CREATED shipment and persists the state change: Verifies POST /confirm on CREATED moves to CONFIRMED and persists via separate GET\n              2. idempotently confirms an already CONFIRMED shipment: Verifies repeated confirms succeed and return CONFIRMED, unchanged via GET\n              3. rejects confirming a CANCELLED shipment with error code: Verifies 409 Conflict with SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE code, state unchanged via GET\n              4. reports unknown shipment when confirming: Verifies 404 Not Found with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND code\n\nVerification  Command: ./mvnw test (from sample-service/)\n              Result: BUILD SUCCESS - Tests run: 17, Failures: 0, Errors: 0, Skipped: 0\n              All 5 original shipment tests pass + 4 new confirm tests pass\n\nNot done      None. All acceptance criteria met: build passes, existing tests pass, new endpoint implemented with correct status transitions, error responses consistent with API patterns, idempotency works, cancelled/unknown cases handled, no new dependencies, no unrelated changes.\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4735,"cache_read_input_tokens":26612,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4735},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b6994d43-2180-4380-ae20-e262e9ff9139","uuid":"3cba93ec-821f-460a-8b21-eba686a97957","timestamp":"2026-09-09T17:53:22.060Z","request_id":"req_011CetHuovBUSi4HWwh9pUpW"}
